      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved, more understandable version of the test.Now I'll run the compile check.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored test introduces a descriptive local variable `none` to avoid repeating `JsonAutoDetect.Visibility.NONE`, renames variables to convey their purpose (`allNoneValue`, `scalarConstructorOverride`, `result`), and adds a Javadoc comment explaining the intent of the `withOverrides` identity-return behavior being verified."
    }
